  "description": "Lexion, leader of the Villain Alliance, and Yu Seo-Na, Korea's hero, became husband and wife. The fact that he had disbanded the Alliance by winning over its leader with love became a global sensation. But the truth remained unknown to all. ‘If she's pinned beneath me, impaled on my cock, will she cry like that?’ What exactly was Lexion's ability? Not even his wife, the former hero Yu Seo-Na, knew.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: The eighth story in Metatoon's Gyeryak Danpyeonseon (계략 단편선) Collection.*",
